WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.020
Before we say goodbye,

2
00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:02.010
let's play a quick round

3
00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:02.860
of Drewth or Dare

4
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.500
because you can ask me anything

5
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.770
or dare me to do anything.

6
00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:10.930
And we have Terry Perry here.

7
00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:12.313 line:15%
Hi Terry.

8
00:00:13.641 --> 00:00:14.474 line:15%
Hey, Drew.

9
00:00:14.474 --> 00:00:16.400 line:15%
Do you know how happy your name is?

10
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.320 line:15%
Very, no relation to Tyler but you know?

11
00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:20.690 line:15%
Well, it's giving me joy.

12
00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:22.076 line:15%
Drewth or Dare?

13
00:00:22.076 --> 00:00:22.909
Drewth.

14
00:00:22.909 --> 00:00:23.742
Okay.

15
00:00:23.742 --> 00:00:26.590
So we had two lovely sisters here earlier

16
00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:28.900
and you gifted them ornaments.

17
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.290
What's one of your favorite ornaments

18
00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:32.590
during the holiday season?

19
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.590
One of my favorites is a mushroom.

20
00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:39.970
I was in Northern California

21
00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:42.360
and I was like in a little town,

22
00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:46.090
like on Main Street,

23
00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:48.320
and I bought this little mushroom,

24
00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:51.240
and it was one of the first ornaments I collected,

25
00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:53.220
and I was pregnant.

26
00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:56.560
And I just thought here is where it begins.

27
00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:59.162
So let's begin.

28
00:00:59.162 --> 00:01:02.894
(audience cheering)

29
00:01:02.894 --> 00:01:04.580
And it's my first ornament that I bought.

30
00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:06.173
And it's still my favorite.

31
00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:09.320
So thank you for asking me, Terry Perry.

32
00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:10.780
No problem, Drew Barrymore.

33
00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:13.516
And the happiest of holidays to you.

34
00:01:13.516 --> 00:01:14.933
And thank you for choosing to spend your time with us.

35
00:01:16.983 --> 00:01:19.754
We make this show for you,

36
00:01:19.754 --> 00:01:21.421
so take it with you.

37
00:01:22.562 --> 00:01:25.145 line:15%
(upbeat music)

